{"id":328313,"bangumiId":328313,"type":2,"name":"世界最高の暗殺者、異世界貴族に転生する","name_cn":"世界顶尖的暗杀者转生为异世界贵族","date":"2021-10-06","year":"2021","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/49/32/328313_oQlyW.jpg"},"summary":"世界第一的暗杀者投胎成暗杀世家的长男重生了。作为能够转生到异世界的条件，他接下了女神给下达的唯一一项任务。\r\n那就是“杀了被预言会带给人类灾厄的‘勇者’”。\r\n这是曾经世界上最强暗杀者在新的人生中必须要完成的使命。在现代曾让万般暗杀方式变得可行的广泛知识及经验，还有暗杀者家族被誉为异世界最强的秘术与魔法。一切都相辅相成，使他逐步成为史上无人能及的暗杀者——\r\n“有意思，真没想到转生后还要继续从事暗杀工作啊”\r\n得以转生的“传说中的暗杀者”向更高境界进发！突破极限的冒险幻想谭，现在开幕！！","rating":{"rank":7395,"total":8650,"count":{"1":31,"2":40,"3":120,"4":344,"5":1458,"6":3599,"7":2370,"8":514,"9":60,"10":114},"score":6.1},"collection":{"on_hold":456,"dropped":705,"wish":1163,"collect":15315,"doing":993},"tags":[{"name":"异世界","count":2393,"total_count":275295},{"name":"龙傲天","count":1562,"total_count":40921},{"name":"2021年10月","count":1331,"total_count":23435},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1287,"total_count":510786},{"name":"后宫","count":1253,"total_count":312541},{"name":"战斗","count":968,"total_count":492109},{"name":"SILVERLINK.","count":890,"total_count":36770},{"name":"TV","count":794,"total_count":1451392},{"name":"奇幻","count":679,"total_count":494431},{"name":"穿越","count":486,"total_count":66195},{"name":"2021","count":460,"total_count":80660},{"name":"轻改","count":450,"total_count":156352},{"name":"小说改","count":217,"total_count":168817},{"name":"日本","count":146,"total_count":317276},{"name":"田村正文","count":122,"total_count":388},{"name":"上田麗奈","count":73,"total_count":862},{"name":"厕纸","count":57,"total_count":12901},{"name":"2021年","count":31,"total_count":3715},{"name":"转生","count":30,"total_count":5955},{"name":"恋爱","count":29,"total_count":585851},{"name":"世界顶尖的暗杀者转生为异世界贵族